message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "RIS Deployment Planning Tool"
abstract: >-
  A single-file MATLAB application that computes site-specific link
  budgets for RIS-assisted hybrid RF/FSO relay deployments in rural
  Zimbabwe. It evaluates end-to-end outage probability, ergodic capacity
  and average bit error rate, converts the required average SNR into
  required transmit power, and ships terrain (Nakagami-m) and season
  (Gamma-Gamma) presets taken from published studies of comparable
  environments, with user-defined parameters as an alternative.
